<title>SINGAPORE: Brunei raises June term crude prices-sources.</title>
<headline>Brunei raises June term crude prices-sources.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brunei has raised the term lifting price of its Seria Light and Champion crudes by 45 cents per barrel for June compared with May, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It set the June Seria Light price at $21.35, up from $20.90 in May.</p>
<p>Champion was set at $21.15 for June, up from $20.70 the previous month.</p>
<p>Brunei sets it term lifting prices retroactively.</p>
<p>The July provision price for Seria Light was set at $19.20, with Champion set at $19.00.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3571)</p>
</text>
